# Start of the course as rebuilt by the organizers on 2026-11-07 (they withheld exact dimensions).
# From Darion's CORRECTED drawing (2026-11-07 ~19:35; feet grid, map m = ft * 0.3048 - 3.048), approximate.
# Darion's wall end points are taken as the faces at the CP2 gap, so the gap's free width is his 0.752 m:
# each wall's 4 in thickness lies on the side AWAY from the gap. Boxes in the published OBJ's frame
# (x east, y north, z up, metres). Used with dronehacks-course-v3.obj, whose maze dividers M1, M2, M3 were
# removed (course.yaml excludes them). Built by hand (chelsea-claude), not the organizers' CAD.

